@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Political\nAgent" as Agent
participant ":System" as System

activate Agent

    Agent -> System : asks to submit a new declaration of interests
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows declaration type list (initial, regular, exceptional)\nand asks to select one
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : selects declaration type
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows registered institutions and functions;\nrequests position/income entries (institution, function,\nnature, payment)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides one or more position/income entries
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests support and subsidy data\n(source institution, nature, amount)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides support and subsidy data (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests asset data\n(type: urban/rural, description, estimated value)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides asset entries (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : requests business participation data\n(company name, quota/share percentage, market value)
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : provides business participation entries (or skips if none)
    activate System

        System --> Agent : shows full declaration summary and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Agent -> System : confirms submission
    activate System

        System --> Agent : displays operation success;\ndeclaration set to "pending validation" state
    deactivate System

deactivate Agent

@enduml
